<!-- I2RT YAM (6-DOF arm + parallel gripper, 8 DOF) in MJCF form, generated from yam.urdf with MuJoCo
     3.9 (MjSpec.from_string with balanceinertia="true" fusestatic="false", so the jointless root body 'base'
     survives for holosoma's fixed-base rule; then the URDF's placeholder actuatorfrcrange="-1 1" removed and the
     geom colours replaced by the two named materials). Body order [base, link1, link2, link3, link4, link5,
     gripper, tip_left, tip_right] and joint order joint1..joint8 equal the URDF tree and the 'yam' preset. The
     mesh geoms are the collision geoms (the URDF ships one mesh per link). No actuators: holosoma adds a torque
     motor per DOF at load; limits, armature and friction come from the preset. Source and license: README.md /
     LICENSE. -->
